      "text": "@_akhaliq What sticks with me: the model never gets updated, the context does. One demo + sim rehearsal as memory, not training — and it still hits 83% across all 50 tasks. Where do the remaining failures cluster — sim-to-real mismatch, or tasks where one demo can't pin down intent?",
